msgid ":ref:`動径分布関数<radial-distribution-function>`\\ は、同じ時刻の原子対の距離を集計して局所構造を調べる。"
msgstr ""
"The :ref:`radial distribution function <radial-distribution-function>`\\"
"  characterizes local structure by counting pair distances at the same "
"instant."

